§7--------------------------------------------------
Tag command
§cUsage:
  §b/tag §7[§eoptions§7] §7<§etarget§7>

§cOptions:
§e  -f§7, §e--force§7, §e--yes§7: Skip confirmation
§e  -v§7, §e--verbose§7 (up to 3 times)§7: More output
§e  -t §7<§etag§7>§7, §e--tag §7<§etag§7>§7 (required, up to 5 times)§7: Tag to add
§7--------------------------------------------------
